### 岚途 LayCoo · 接口调试样例
### 1. 登录获取 token（管理员）
# @name loginAdmin
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### 2. 普通用户登录
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "demo",
  "password": "demo123"
}

### 3. 注册
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "traveler01",
  "password": "travel123",
  "nickname": "旅行者一号"
}

### 4. 分类与标签
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/category/list

###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tag/hot?limit=10

### 5. 内容列表（公开）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/content/list?page=1&size=6&sort=hot

### 按分类筛选
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/content/list?categoryCode=FOOD&page=1&size=6

### 按类型 + 区域筛选
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/content/list?type=HUMANITY&area=西湖区&page=1&size=6

### 6. 内容详情与相关推荐
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/content/1

###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/content/1/related?size=4

### 7. 搜索
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/search?keyword=西湖&page=1&size=9

###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/search/hot

### 8. 推荐
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/recommend/home?size=8

###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/recommend/hot?limit=8

###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/recommend/similar/1?size=4

### 9. 互动（需要普通用户 token）
@token = 请替换为 demo 登录返回的 token

POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/favorite
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contentId": 1
}

###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/favorite/list?page=1&size=12
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/like
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contentId": 1
}

###
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/comment
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contentId": 1,
  "content": "醋鱼好吃，建议错峰去。"
}

###
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/rate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contentId": 1,
  "score": 5
}

###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/interaction/stats?contentId=1

### 10. 管理端（需要 admin token）
@adminToken = 请替换为 admin 登录返回的 token

GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/content/list?status=PENDING&page=1&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/content/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 查看待审内容详情
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/content/19
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 审核通过
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/content/audit
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 19,
  "action": "APPROVE",
  "remark": "审核通过"
}

### 创建 AI 生成任务
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/ai/task
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryCode": "FOOD",
  "area": "西湖区",
  "count": 2,
  "keywords": "茶文化、本地小吃"
}

### 任务列表与统计
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/ai/task/list?page=1&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/ai/task/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
